# Frontend Rules

## Allowed

- Server Components by default
- shadcn/ui primitives in `src/components/ui/`
- Shared presentation components in `src/components/shared/`
- Feature-specific components in `src/features/<domain>/components/`
- Scoped booking flow context (`BookingFlowProvider`) — not global state
- Pure reducer for booking state (`booking-flow-reducer.ts`)
- `getTranslations()` in Server Components
- `useTranslations()` in Client Components
- Logical CSS properties for RTL (`ms-`, `me-`, `ps-`, `pe-`)
- `formatMoney()` for price display only
- Tailwind CSS utility classes
- `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts` for class merging

## Forbidden

- `"use client"` without a clear interaction need
- Database or repository imports in components
- Business logic in JSX (pricing, capacity, eligibility)
- Client-side price or total calculation
- Hardcoded user-facing strings (use next-intl)
- `next/link` or `next/navigation` for locale routes (use `@/i18n/navigation`)
- Physical direction CSS in booking components (`ml-`, `mr-`, `left-`, `right-`)
- Giant components (>150 lines without extraction)
- Unnecessary `useEffect`
- Client-side data fetching when SSR works
- PII in URL query parameters

## Booking UI patterns

- Locations loaded in Server Component, passed as props
- Quote via `POST /api/quote`; requote with `selection` field
- Reservation via `POST /api/reservations` + `Idempotency-Key`
- See `/docs/BOOKING_UI.md`

## Component placement

- UI primitives → `src/components/ui/`
- Cross-feature shared → `src/components/shared/`
- Domain-specific → `src/features/<domain>/components/`
